# Vector file for testcase3/full_adder_rtl.v.
# One line = one test cycle. Each token is name=bit. a/b/cin are inputs
# (driven); s/cout are outputs (checked against the value given here).
# All 8 combinations of a,b,cin, plus one X-propagation case.
a=0 b=0 cin=0 s=0 cout=0
a=0 b=0 cin=1 s=1 cout=0
a=0 b=1 cin=0 s=1 cout=0
a=0 b=1 cin=1 s=0 cout=1
a=1 b=0 cin=0 s=1 cout=0
a=1 b=0 cin=1 s=0 cout=1
a=1 b=1 cin=0 s=0 cout=1
a=1 b=1 cin=1 s=1 cout=1
a=x b=0 cin=0 s=x cout=0
